(50, 18, '_pubad_circular_search_index', '03/2025 2026-07-21 2026 Registration of public officers under the Widows\' and Orphans\' / Widowers\' and Orphans\' Pension Scheme and the verification of their beneficiaries\' information through a new online information system. රාජ්‍ය නිලධරයන් වැන්දඹු / වැන්දඹු පුරුෂ හා අනත්දරු විශ්‍රාම වැටුප් ක්‍රමයෙහි ලියාපදිංචි කිරීම සහ ඔවුන්ගේ ප්‍රතිලාභීන්ගේ තොරතුරු සත්‍යාපනය, නව මාර්ගගත තොරතුරු පද්ධතියක් ඔස්සේ සිදු කිරීම அரசாங்க உத்தியோகத்தர்கள் விதவைகள்/ தபுதாரர்கள் மற்றும் அனாதைகள் ஓய்வூதிய முறைமையில் பதிவு செய்தல் மற்றும் அவர்களின் பயனாளிகளின் தகவல்களை உறுதிப்படுத்தலை புதிய நிகழ்நிலை தகவல் முறைமையினூடாக செயற்படுத்தல். P ubli c Admini stra ti on C i rc ular : 03/2025 ( II M y No P ns/P 4/ W & OP/ F 11 Mini str y of P ubli c Admini stra ti on, P rovinc ial C ounc il s a nd L oc a l Gove rnme nt I nd e pe nde n c e S qua re C olom bo 07 . 2026.07 . 21 S e c re ta rie s of Mini stries C hief S e c re ta rie s of Prov ince s He a ds of D e pa rtme nts Dist ric t S e c re ta rie s/ C omm a nde rs of the T h re e Ar med F orc e s I nspe c tor G e ne ra l o f Pol ice Divis ional S e c re tar ies He a ds of L o c a l Gov e rnm e nt I nsti tut ions Re gistr ation of p u b li c off ice r s u n d e r the Wid ow s \' an d Orp h an s\' / Wi d ow e r s\' a n d Orph an s\' P e n sion S c h e m e an d the ve r if icat ion of the ir b e n e f iciar ies\' i n f or m ation thr ou gh a n e w on l in e in f or m atio n syste m . Your a tt e nti on is dra wn to P ubli c Admini stra ti on C irc ular 03/2025 iss ue d on 20.01.2025 a nd P ubli c Admini stra ti on C i rc ular 03/2025 ( I e d on 17.11.2025 r e g a rdin g the a bove matter . Ac c ordin g l y , since the ti me pe riod g r a nted for th e re g ist ra ti on, upda ti ng o f infor mation, a nd ve rif ica ti on of be ne f icia r y d e tails throug h the ne wl y int rodu c e d onli ne infor mation s y stem e x pire d on 28.02.2026, the f a c il it y p rovide d f or the sa id a c ti vit ies in the a f