(75, 22, '_pubad_circular_search_index', '16/2026 2026-07-17 2026 Payment of the Cost-of-Living Allowance to Public Officers Entitled to Exercise Political Rights Who Submitted Nominations to Contest the Local Authorities Election, 2023 2023 පළාත් පාලන ආයතන ඡන්ද විමසීමට ඉදිරිපත් වීම සඳහා නාමයෝජනා භාර දුන් දේශපාලන අයිතිවාසිකම් හිමි රාජ්‍ය නිලධරයන්ට ජීවන වියදම් දීමනාව ගෙවීම 2023 உள்ளூராட்சி அதிகாரசபைகள் தேர்தலில் போட்டியிடுவதற்கு வேட்புமனுக்களை சமர்ப்பித்த அரசியல் உரிமைகளுக்கு உரித்துடைய அரச உத்தியோகத்தர்களுக்கு வாழ்க்கைச் செலவுக் கொடுப்பனவுகளை செலுத்துதல் P ubli c Admini stra ti on C i rc ular 16/2026 M y number ES T - 3/ /P O L / Mini str y o f P ubli c Admin ist ra ti on P rovinc ial C ounc il s a nd L oc a l Gove rnme nt I nd e pe nde n c e S qua re C olom bo 17 .07. S e c re ta rie s to Mini stries C hief S e c re ta rie s of Prov ince s He a ds of D e pa rtme nts P a y m ent of the C o s t - of - L i v i n g A l l o w a nc e to P ubl i c O ff i ce rs E nti t l ed t o E x er c i s e P o l i ti ca l R i g hts Wh o Su bm i tted N o m i n a ti o n s to C o nte s t the Loc a l A ut ho r i t i e s El ect i o n, 2 0 2 3 Y our a tt e nti on is dra wn to P ubli c Admini s tra ti on C irc ular 06/2023 da ted 06.04.2023 a nd P ubli c Admini stra ti on C irc ular 25/2025 da ted 26.09.2 02 5, whic h w e re iss ue d to provide r e li e f to publi c of fic e rs e nti tl e d to e x e r c ise poli ti c a l ri g hts wh o subm it ted nomi na ti on s to c ontest the L o c a l Author it ies Ele c ti on, 2023. It ha s b e e n de c ided a t the mee ti ng of the C a bin e t of Mini ster s he ld on to pa y the C ost - of - L ivi n g A ll owa nc e a s we ll to the of fic e rs , who we re p a id the ba si c sa lar y in a c c ord a nc e with the provisions of t he sa id c irc ular s , fo r the pe riod during whic h th e ba sic sa lar y wa s p a id . Ac c ordin g l y , a c ti on must be tak e n to p a y the C ost - of - L i ving A ll ow a nc e in a ddit ion to the ba si c sa lar y pa id t o