(275, 54, '_pubad_circular_search_index', '02/2026 2026-04-29 2026 Promotion to Special Class of Government Translators’ Service on seniority in accordance with the Minute on the Translators’ Service භාෂා පරිවර්තක සේවා ව්‍යවස්ථාව අනුව රජයේ භාෂා පරිවර්තක සේවයේ විශේෂ පන්තියට ජ්‍යෙෂ්ඨතාවය මත උසස් කිරීම மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர் சேவைப் பிரமாணக் குறிப்பின் பிரகாரம் மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர் சேவையில் விசேட வகுப்பிற்கு சேவை மூப்பின் அடிப்படையில் தரமுயர்த்துதல் C om bined S e rvic e s C irc ular : 02 /2 026 My N u m b e r : C S / V I I / G T S / P r o m o t i o n Mini str y of P ubli c Admin ist ra ti on & P rovinc ial C ounc il s a nd L oc a l Gove rnme nt I nd e pe nde n c e S qua re C olom bo 07. 29 .0 4 .20 26 S e c re ta rie s of M i n i s t r i e s He a ds of D e pa rtme nts Dist ric t S e c re ta rie s Divis ional S e c re tar ies P r o m otion to S p e c ial Cl ass of G o v e r n m e n t S e r vi c e on S e n iorit y in ac c or d an c e w ith the M i n u te o f the G ove r n m e n t I n a c c o rda nc e with the provisions of the Tr a nslator S e rvic e M inut e publi she d in the Ga z e tt e Ex tra ordina r y No. 829/ 7 da ted 26 th J ul y 1994 a nd the a pprov a l of t he P ubli c S e rvic e C om mi ssi on re c e ived in thi s re g a rd via the letter of the S e c re tar y of t he P ubli c S e rvic e C omm iss ion No. P S C /E S T/03 - 05/02/ 2018 da t e d 21.04.2026 , a ppli c a ti ons a re c a ll e d fr om off ice rs of the Gov e rnme nt Tr a nslators S e rvic e f or the promoti on to the S pe c ial C lass of the Gove rnme nt Tr a nslators S e rvic e . 02. The s a lar y s e g ment MN 6 - 20 25 (Step 23 of P ubli c Admini stra ti on C irc ular 10/2025 da ted 25.03.2025 is de t e r mi ne d to thi s post a nd the mont hl y s a lar y s c a le r e leva nt to thi s post is R s. 62,230 10 x 119 0 11 x 1360 15 x 1670 114,140 . Ac c ordin g to the sa id c irc ula r, the 23 rd step of that sc a le is R s.90,760. 03. Me thodol og y for e v a luation : - I. Appointm e nts for 40% of the va c